@ Greg follows the journey; each stop owns a saved win bit.

GregRoam_GoldenrodCity::
	trainerbattle_single TRAINER_GREG_GOLDENROD_CITY, GregRoam_GoldenrodCity_Seen, GregRoam_GoldenrodCity_Beaten
	call GregRoam_Reward
	msgbox GregRoam_GoldenrodCity_After, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	end
GregRoam_GoldenrodCity_Seen:
	.string "Greg: Scott booked dinner?\nCute. I booked six\plevel-99 problems.$"
GregRoam_GoldenrodCity_Beaten:
	.string "Greg: I was distracted by\nScott's terrible flirting.$"
GregRoam_GoldenrodCity_After:
	.string "Greg: Scott says you\nlooked cute winning. I say\psuspicious.$"

